(text "MicroSquirt: RPM / TPS / MAP / CLT over CAN. Do not join its 5 V output to ECU VREF_5.\nSPEED jumpers: verify which speed sensor the 1997 transmission provides; select one matched pair only.\nJ120 pin 17 parks the OD lamp; no verified MicroSquirt output assignment is assumed.\nSS1 -> Solenoid A and SS2 -> B are the planned mapping, requiring transmission truth-table confirmation.\nRange excitation and calibration cannot be finalized without resistance/voltage measurements." (at 15 233 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a9c71b3d-635b-5d31-a86f-893e68f5e602))
